Package: pubmedsearchworkflow
Title: Reusable PubMed Systematic Search Workflow
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dr. Scott", "Coffin", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "scott.l.coffin@gmail.com")
Description: Helpers for building, chunking, running, and exporting PubMed
    searches used in systematic-review workflows. The package keeps study-specific
    search strings outside the reusable code so collaborators can adapt the
    workflow to new topics.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/ScottCoffin/PubMed_Systematic_Search
BugReports: https://github.com/ScottCoffin/PubMed_Systematic_Search/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    crayon,
    easyPubMed,
    methods,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
